WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.488
Priya: Just to recap, carry forward the blocked expansion. Today's focus stays evidence and test coverage.
小结一下，受阻扩展结转。今天仍聚焦证据和测试覆盖。

2
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:15.624
Lukas: Rotation feedback at two, approval after coverage. No production restart is authorized by this standup.
两点给轮转反馈，覆盖完整后才批准。站会不授权生产重启。

3
00:00:15.624 --> 00:00:23.304
Raj: Okay, the rollout remains blocked on approval. I'll update that dependency around lunchtime today.
好，上线仍受审批阻塞。我今天午饭前后更新该依赖。

4
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:31.320
Hannah: And the driver image is still pending. I'll report availability without assuming test success.
驱动镜像仍未到位，我会报告可用性，不假定测试成功。

5
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:38.520
Anika: My action item stays the limits report. Effective settings and resource impact both included.
我的待办仍是上限报告，包括实际设置和资源影响。

6
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:46.680
Priya: Just to confirm, take it offline for details, right? Keep remaining implementation discussion outside standup.
我确认一下，细节会后单独聊，对吧？剩余实现讨论留在站会外。

7
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:53.280
Lukas: Yes, I can join the review thread. Please keep separate changes in separate requests.
是，我可以参与评审讨论。不同变更继续分开提请求。

8
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:59.712
Raj: Roughly ten minutes after this for pairing. Hannah and I will check the assertions.
会后大约十分钟结对，我和Hannah检查断言。

9
00:00:59.712 --> 00:01:07.440
Hannah: That fits before my next meeting starts. I'll link results rather than repeat details tomorrow.
能赶在下次会议前完成，明天附结果链接，不重复细节。

10
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:14.040
Priya: So, we're done with today's standup. Next check-in tomorrow, same time and owners.
今天站会结束。明天同一时间检查进展，负责人不变。

